sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst
    participant Agent as AI / MCP Client
    participant Gate as Bank Gateway (target)
    participant Adapter as Read-only Adapter (target)
    participant Bank as Payment Hub / Archive
    participant Tool as MCP Investigation Tool
    participant Engine as Deterministic Evidence Core

    Analyst->>Agent: Investigate REF123 (authorized purpose)
    opt Future live retrieval; not implemented
        Agent->>Gate: get_payment_evidence(REF123)
        Gate->>Gate: Authenticate and authorize; minimize PII; audit
        alt Access denied or missing consent
            Gate-->>Agent: Denied, no payment data returned
        else Authorized read
            Gate->>Adapter: Reference-bound read request
            Adapter->>Bank: Fetch original payment and status XML
            Bank-->>Adapter: Source-identified messages + timestamps
            Adapter-->>Agent: Minimum approved evidence
        end
    end
    Agent->>Tool: tools/list / validate_message(pacs.008)
    Tool->>Engine: Parse, validate, mark untrusted free text
    Engine-->>Agent: Business / schema / security outcomes
    Agent->>Tool: investigate_payment(pacs.008, pacs.002)
    Tool->>Engine: Exact ID correlation, code lookup, source ledger
    alt Missing match, unknown code or incomplete evidence
        Engine-->>Agent: Unmatched / unknown + human escalation
    else Bank-reported RJCT / AC04
        Engine-->>Agent: Field evidence + reported meaning + limitations
    end
    Agent-->>Analyst: Explain evidence; no automatic retry
    Note over Agent,Bank: No payment-write method is exposed by PEI
